      "Language": "ger",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Intrapericardially supplied agents for instance cardioactive drugs were transferred via lymph vessels in the myocardium likely. In case of dye application the myocardium and also the cardiac valves were coloured additionally. The effect on the heart should be more intensive and faster than after systemic application."},
